<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>6. Provider:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The Provider is a component that has a reference to the Sto=
re and provides the data from the Store to the component it wraps.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>7. Connect:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Connect is a function that communicates with the Provider.<=
/p>
