<p dir=3D"auto">Redux is the most popular State container library for front=
end apps. It helps you manage your state in a predictable and easy way.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Installation:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">React Redux 9.x requires <strong>React 18</strong> or later=
. React Redux 8.x supports React 16.8.3+.</p>
