<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Note:</strong> <code>createStore</code> has been <s=
trong>deprecated</strong> since Redux 4.2.0. The recommended approach is <c=
ode>configureStore</code> from <code>@reduxjs/toolkit</code> (shown below).=
</p>
</blockquote>
