<p dir=3D"auto">There is typically a payload value that contains what the u=
ser is sending and would be used to update the state of the application. It=
 is important to note that action.type is required, but action.payload is o=
ptional. Making use of payload brings a level of structure to how the actio=
n object looks like.</p>
