<p dir=3D"auto">Reducers are pure functions that take the current state of =
an application, perform an action, and return a new state. These states are=
 stored as objects, and they specify how the state of an application change=
s in response to an action sent to the store.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">It is based on the reduce function in JavaScript, where a s=
ingle value is calculated from multiple values after a callback function ha=
s been carried out.</p>
