<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Redux Thunk:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Redux Thunk is a middleware that lets you call action creat=
ors that return a function instead of an action object. That function recei=
ves the store's dispatch method, which is then used to dispatch regular syn=
chronous actions inside the body of the function once the asynchronous oper=
ations have completed.</p>
