<p dir=3D"auto">Saga is like a separate thread in your application, that is=
 solely responsible for side effects. <code>redux-saga</code> is a redux mi=
ddleware, which means this thread can be <strong>started</strong>, <strong>=
paused</strong> and <strong>cancelled</strong> from the main application wi=
th normal Redux actions, it has access to the full Redux application state =
and it can dispatch Redux actions as well.</p>
