<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>RTK Query</strong> is a powerful data fetching and =
caching tool built directly into Redux Toolkit (<code>@reduxjs/toolkit</cod=
e>). It is designed to simplify common cases for loading data in a web appl=
ication, eliminating the need to hand-write data fetching and caching logic=
 yourself.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">RTK Query is included in the core <code>@reduxjs/toolkit</c=
ode> package and can be imported from two entry points:</p>
