<p dir=3D"auto">RTK Query uses a <strong>tag-based cache invalidation</stro=
ng> system to automatically refetch data when it becomes stale after a muta=
tion.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>How it works:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>Queries declare which tags they <strong>provide</strong> (<code>provide=
sTags</code>)</li>
<li>Mutations declare which tags they <strong>invalidate</strong> (<code>in=
validatesTags</code>)</li>
<li>When a mutation runs successfully, RTK Query automatically refetches al=
l queries whose provided tags match the invalidated tags</li>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example: Posts CRUD with tags</strong></p>
