<p dir=3D"auto"><code>createSlice</code> is a function that accepts an init=
ial state, an object full of reducer functions, and a "slice name", and aut=
omatically generates action creators and action types that correspond to th=
e reducers and state.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Automatically generates action creators with the same names as the redu=
cer functions</li>
<li>Automatically generates action types based on the slice name and reduce=
r names</li>
<li>Allows you to write "mutating" logic using Immer inside reducers</li>
<li>Reduces boilerplate code significantly</li>
</ul>
