<p dir=3D"auto"><code>createEntityAdapter</code> provides a standardized wa=
y to store your data in a slice by taking a collection and putting it into =
the shape of <code>{ ids: [], entities: {} }</code>. It generates a set of =
prebuilt reducers and selectors for performing CRUD operations on normalize=
d state.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Provides prebuilt reducers for common operations (add, update, remove)<=
/li>
<li>Automatically generates memoized selectors</li>
<li>Handles normalization of data</li>
<li>Reduces boilerplate code for entity management</li>
<li>Efficient updates and lookups</li>
</ul>
