<p dir=3D"auto">Migrating from traditional Redux to Redux Toolkit can be do=
ne gradually. You don't need to rewrite everything at once.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Migration Strategy:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>Install Redux Toolkit</li>
<li>Replace <code>createStore</code> with <code>configureStore</code></li>
<li>Convert reducers to slices one at a time</li>
<li>Replace action creators with slice actions</li>
<li>Convert thunks to <code>createAsyncThunk</code></li>
<li>Optimize with <code>createEntityAdapter</code> where appropriate</li>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Step-by-Step Migration:</strong></p>
