<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Best Practices:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>Start with the simplest reducers first</li>
<li>Migrate one feature at a time</li>
<li>Test thoroughly after each migration</li>
<li>Update tests to work with new structure</li>
<li>Consider using <code>createEntityAdapter</code> for normalized data</li=
>
<li>Remove old dependencies once fully migrated</li>
</ol>
