<p dir=3D"auto">Relay is a JavaScript framework for fetching and managing G=
raphQL data in React applications that emphasizes maintainability, type saf=
ety and runtime performance.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Relay achieves this by combining declarative data fetching =
and a static build step. With declarative data fetching, components declare=
 what data they need, and Relay figures out how to efficiently fetch it. Du=
ring the static build step, Relay validates and optimizes queries, and pre-=
computes artifacts to achieve faster runtime performance.</p>
