<p dir=3D"auto">Where <code>getActiveData()</code> will be a function which=
 returns all the records from <code>someData</code> having the status as <c=
ode>isActive</code>. The drawback with this function is, whenever any part =
of the state state updates, this function will recalculate this data.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">When we use <code>Reselect</code> it caches the input argum=
ents to the memoized function. So only when the arguments of the function c=
hanges from the previous call, the selector recalculates.</p>
