<p dir=3D"auto">Dispatching an action within a reducer is an <strong>anti-p=
attern</strong>. Your reducer should be without side effects, simply digest=
ing the action payload and returning a new state object. Adding listeners a=
nd dispatching actions within the reducer can lead to chained actions and o=
ther side effects.</p>
